@comment openi2pd OpenBSD PLIST template; merge into the external port.
@comment Reserve _i2pd in infrastructure/db/user.list before merge; the number
@comment below is a template placeholder and must not collide with another port.
@newgroup _i2pd:838
@newuser _i2pd:838:838:i2pd:0:0:i2pd account:/var/i2pd:/sbin/nologin
@rcscript ${RCDIR}/i2pd
@comment /var/i2pd is created from share/examples/var/i2pd and is private to
@comment the service account; the certificate tree stays read-only below
@comment /usr/local/share and is not a mutable sample.
